reagent-name-dark-core-coolant-water = RTM water-coolant
reagent-desc-dark-core-coolant-water = A basic cheap coolant. It fouls quickly under radiation.

reagent-name-dark-core-coolant = base RTM coolant
reagent-desc-dark-core-coolant = A heat transfer fluid for dark matter reactor coolers.

reagent-name-dark-core-coolant-plasma = RTM plasma coolant
reagent-desc-dark-core-coolant-plasma = A plasma-based coolant with increased efficiency.

reagent-name-dark-core-coolant-uranium = RTM uranium coolant
reagent-desc-dark-core-coolant-uranium = A uranium-based coolant with maximum efficiency and minimal consumption.

reagent-name-dark-core-coolant-waste = spent RTM coolant
reagent-desc-dark-core-coolant-waste = Coolant saturated with heat and decay products. It needs processing.

reagent-name-dark-core-coolant-cryogel = RTM cryogel
reagent-desc-dark-core-coolant-cryogel = A high-heat-capacity low-temperature coolant. Viscous and requires a chilled loop.

reagent-name-dark-core-coolant-thermosil = RTM thermosil
reagent-desc-dark-core-coolant-thermosil = A heat-resistant coolant for hot loops. It keeps its properties at high temperatures.

reagent-name-dark-core-coolant-radiogel = RTM radiogel
reagent-desc-dark-core-coolant-radiogel = A radiation-resistant gel. It accumulates radioactive contamination and requires filtration.

reagent-name-dark-core-coolant-isotope = RTM isotope coolant
reagent-desc-dark-core-coolant-isotope = A high-efficiency experimental coolant with its own radiation background.

reagent-name-dark-core-coolant-digamma = RTM digamma fluid
reagent-desc-dark-core-coolant-digamma = An extreme coolant with maximum heat transfer. Unstable and dangerous when degraded.
